{
  "an5.44:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 5.44 ",
  "an5.44:0.2": "5. With King Muṇḍa ",
  "an5.44:0.3": "Agreeable ",
  "an5.44:1.1": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Vesālī, at the Great Wood, in the hall with the peaked roof. ",
  "an5.44:1.2": "Then the Buddha robed up in the morning and, taking his bowl and robe, went to the home of the householder Ugga of Vesālī, where he sat down on the seat spread out. ",
  "an5.44:1.3": "Then Ugga went up to the Buddha, bowed, sat down to one side, and said to him, ",
  "an5.44:2.1": "“Sir, I have heard and learned this in the presence of the Buddha: ",
  "an5.44:2.2": "‘The giver of the agreeable gets the agreeable.’ ",
  "an5.44:2.3": "My sal flower porridge is agreeable: ",
  "an5.44:2.4": "may the Buddha please accept it from me out of sympathy.” ",
  "an5.44:2.5": "So the Buddha accepted it out of sympathy. ",
  "an5.44:3.1": "“Sir, I have heard and learned this in the presence of the Buddha: ",
  "an5.44:3.2": "‘The giver of the agreeable gets the agreeable.’ ",
  "an5.44:3.3": "My pork with jujube is agreeable: ",
  "an5.44:3.4": "may the Buddha please accept it from me out of sympathy.” ",
  "an5.44:3.5": "So the Buddha accepted it out of sympathy. ",
  "an5.44:4.1": "",
  "an5.44:4.2": "",
  "an5.44:4.3": "“… My fried vegetable stalks are agreeable: ",
  "an5.44:4.4": "may the Buddha please accept them from me out of sympathy.” ",
  "an5.44:4.5": "So the Buddha accepted them out of sympathy. ",
  "an5.44:5.1": "",
  "an5.44:5